@startuml
title State Machine: Order
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
state Delivered
state Draft
state Paid
state Returned
state Shipped
state Submitted

[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Paid : Checkout
Delivered --> Returned : HandleReturn
Draft --> Submitted : Submit (PlaceOrder)
Submitted --> Paid : MarkPaid (CapturePayment)
Paid --> Shipped : Ship (DispatchOrder)
Shipped --> Delivered : Complete (ConfirmDelivery)
Delivered --> Returned : Return (AcceptReturn)
@enduml
